# SQLite databases — including the ~92MB pft_sitemap.db PFT harvest cache.
# The PFT research record is preserved in Git via the harvest scripts,
# the corpus reports (pft_corpus/PFT_CORPUS_PILOT_REPORT.md), and derived
# results; the raw 92MB database is a regenerable build artifact that would
# bloat every clone and sits near GitHub's 100MB per-file limit.
*.db

